Apple today announced a new <a href="https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2026/08/apple-unveils-a-more-powerful-mac-mini-featuring-the-all-new-m6-and-m5-pro/">Mac mini</a> and <a href="https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2026/08/apple-introduces-new-mac-studio-with-m5-max-and-m5-ultra/">Mac Studio</a>, and pre-orders for both are already live on <a href="https://www.apple.com/shop/buy-mac">Apple's online store</a> and in the Apple Store app in the United States and 30 other countries and regions.<br/>
<br/>
